WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
Welcome to Data Science Tycoon.

2
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:07.000
You've just landed a job as a data scientist
at a demanding tech company.

3
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Your bosses expect flawless data visualizations,
delivered on time, every time.

4
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Take on contracts, master the craft,
and climb the corporate ladder.

5
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Upgrade your tools, hire your team,
and build a reputation that can't be ignored.

6
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Will you rise to the top...
or get buried under the data?

7
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Data Science Tycoon.
